<</Author(Motorola Solutions)/CreationDate(D:20170404145531Z)/Creator(Adobe InDesign CC 2017 \(Windows\))/Keywords(Motorola Solutions; Eemits Communications Limited; Eemits; MOTOTRBO Capacity Max; DP4801e; DM4601e; Digital radio network in North East England; MOTOTRBO Radio Management Customer Programming Software; Motorola OTAP; TRBOnet’ PLUS; TRBOnet; Motorola Servi\
ce from the Start; SFS; managed radio networks; managed digital radio networks; regional radio networks)/ModDate(D:20170404145531Z)/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 15.0)/Subject(Eemits Communications has upgraded its region-wide multiple client network in North East England to a MOTOTRBO Capacity Max network. The network delivers high-performance, next generation digital trunking. The MOTOTRBO Capacity Max network offers all the \
functionality and resilience required and the centralised control gives Eemits the ability to push software and firmware patches to the system server, infrastructure and individual radios. Eemits also hosts the TRBOnet software, ensuring it really does of\
fer its clients an optimal, fully managed service)/Title(UK communications specialist Eemits Communications updates regional network to MOTOTRBO Capacity Max )/Trapped/false>>
